                            <comment id="16810981" author="ptupitsyn" created="Fri, 5 Apr 2019 16:06:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Analysis:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;.NET Core is used&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;PeerAssemblyLoading for System.Configuration.ConfigurationManager hangs: this assembly is not present on any of the nodes (see &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/dotnet/standard/issues/506&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/dotnet/standard/issues/506&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Root cause:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Assembly.Load during peer loading triggers more peer requests if the assembly is not present, this goes on forever if the assembly is not found on any nodes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
